<title>UK: UK's Oftel orders BT to up chargecard prices.</title>
<headline>UK's Oftel orders BT to up chargecard prices.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British telecoms watchdog Oftel said on Friday it had made a provisional order requiring British Telecommunications Plc to raise its chargecard prices.</p>
</text>
